## Capability

Combine the real sensor, firmware, driver and motor with design, physical prototype and instrument views. Expose its public functional interface and only the validated model substitutions.

## Completion checks

- [ ] Change the sensor input and observe the firmware, PWM, load motion and current. Cross-probe the design, reopen offline and replay EB.W01–EB.W07 with low-detail observation and bounded computation.

Compare the authored glow, functional module and wired device in one scene. Lower the board’s visual detail, drop unneeded internal representations and switch only a validated model pair. Keep the firmware pinned or restart explicitly where no state map exists. Report the observed difference in electrical results, memory and computation.

